//
// Room (static attrs) vs RoomInventory (per-room booked-interval calendar) split.
// ReservationRequestBuilder assembles a booking intent step by step.
// PricingStrategy is injected (Strategy) so pricing rules change independently.
// BookingNotifier is a thin Observer subject for booking lifecycle events.
// Hotel is the facade orchestrating search/book/cancel.
//
